OL,3,AKing praises Strait of Hormuz peace
OL,4,Aefforts at glittering banquet
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd over a dinner of pheasant and
OL,7,Fquince, he praised Oman's diplomatic
OL,8,Fmediation in the conflict with Iran to
OL,9,Festablish "where common ground might be
OL,10,Ffound".
